definition:
means any day other than -

- (a) Saturday;

- (b) Sunday;

- (c) a bank holiday under the Bank Holidays Act 1989;

- (d) a day declared by Treasury order, which has effect in the Isle of Man by virtue of the provisions of section 1(1) of the Banking and Financial Dealings (Isle of Man) Act 1973, to be a non-business day;
